# The city spends money and the player decides on what — plans/0070 task 9.
#
# godot --path src/Borough.Godot -- --ruleset rulesets/funded.toml --citizens 2000 \
#   --govern --drive scripts/ui/school-funding.drive \
#   --record artifacts/school-funding/session.drive
#
# Four schools are bought out of the treasury, staff themselves, are funded per declared
# post, and are then defunded by hand on Day 26 by setting school_funding to 0 in the
# Government panel. Every second Day writes the caption and the panel state, so the
# school's places, its staff and the treasury are all on the record.
#
# ⚠ The window is PINNED, because the Government panel is driven by pointer coordinates
# and its layout is anchored top-left in pixels. A different size moves the field.

